netfilter: nf_tables: avoid false-positive lockdep splats with flowtables

jira KERNEL-1646
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-687.51.1.el9_8
commit-author Florian Westphal <fw@strlen.de>
commit b3e8f29d6b45e865bab9a9964709ff7413e33e85
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-687.51.1.el9_8/b3e8f29d.failed

The transaction mutex prevents concurrent add/delete, its ok to iterate
those lists outside of rcu read side critical sections.

	Signed-off-by: Florian Westphal <fw@strlen.de>
	Signed-off-by: Pablo Neira Ayuso <pablo@netfilter.org>
(cherry picked from commit b3e8f29d6b45e865bab9a9964709ff7413e33e85)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

